# These two are GENERATED by gen_assets.py but are BUILD INPUTS: main.c
# includes entities.inc, and data.asm incbins npc.pal. The repo-wide
# ignore rules (*.inc, *.pal) would drop them, which is exactly what
# happened — the example was unbuildable from a clean clone until CI
# caught it. Negate the ignore rather than relying on `git add -f`,
# which any later `git add -A` silently undoes.
!entities.inc
!npc.pal
